{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/586552-beast-yaritza-ramirez-makara-ravager","id":586552,"title":"[Beast] Yaritza Ramirez - Makara Ravager","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-10T16:36:01-07:00","id":586552,"title":"[Beast] Yaritza Ramirez - Makara Ravager","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Just a character I wrote up for a story. Let me know what y'all think.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Concept: </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Desert Siren</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Yaritza \u201cMartina\u201d Ram\u00edrez</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Makara Predator</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Concept: </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Yaritza is a sad creature, whose original brood was killed by a gang of Heroes while she was away. One Hero stayed behind and almost killed her, so she fled. She ended up in the Guajira Peninsula in Colombia, where she set up a small business leading travelers through the desert. Here she felt safe: she only deals in cash and goes by the name \u201cMartina\u201d locally, and tries not to lay down any roots. When she\u2019s feeling hungry, she either dumps one of her clients into the desert and hounds them for days until they find their way back to a nearby city, starving and thirsty. Sometimes she picks a criminal and lets them die. She makes sure not to exclusively pick her own clients: sometimes she\u2019ll sabotage a rival guide\u2019s vehicle and follow them to the middle of the desert to start the hunt.</span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Typical means of sating her hunger is driving a subject out into the Guajira Desert and getting them hopelessly lost for a while; if it\u2019s a violent criminal who\u2019s traveling to a hideout or something similar, she might wait until he dies of dehydration.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Her mentor and former broodmate taught her the lesson of Acceptance: There is a place in this universe for you, and places you shall never reach. To try is self-abnegation.</span></span></li> </ul><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Kinship:</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Yaritza discovered the tomb of Djet-Hu-Ta by accident. She hounded a prey into what she thought was an abandoned town and waited for him to come out.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">And she waited. And waited. For days. When her own food and water were running low, she ventured into the city to find the man, and discovered Djet-Hu-Ta and her cult. They had killed the prey for trespassing, but Yaritza was not afraid. She kept an eye on the location until she felt safe enough to approach, and introduced herself to the Arisen privately.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Djet-Hu-Ta was mildly intrigued by the \u201cantlion desert monster\u201d revealing itself as a middle-aged woman. The two discussed religion, Djet-Hu-Ta mused that Yaritza may be a servant of one of the Judges (perhaps in the guise of the Dark Mother), and as a servant of Arem-Abfu, was ultimately accepting of the Beast.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Now Yaritza has a new purpose: Her prey are potential cultists and tomb robbers. The potential cultists she hounds towards a special initiation region to be tested. The tomb robbers she chases into the desert where they\u2019re never seen again.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Perhaps she will find peace along with her purpose.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Lair Description: </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Heart of her Lair is a massive desert, with a pile of Iremite pillars in the middle. It stretches for miles in all directions. It blends seamlessly with her innermost Chamber, the foothills of a mountain chain based off of the Serran\u00eda de Macuira. The mountain itself is the next Chamber. The outermost chamber is an expansive city ruin, modeled after the abandoned town where she first met Djet-Hu-Ta\u2019s cult. The burrows of her lair are simple: you start at the city and go inward: the challenge is enduring the heat, and other elements of the desert. Djet-Hu-Ta is the Apex. Because of this, whispers can be heard on the wind coming from seemingly random directions that deliver messages of purpose and direction to travelers: these whispers can either help or hurt the traveler, depending on the whims of Fate.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Horror Description: </span></b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">The vast desert lands...</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">A giant trail drifts through the sky...</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Thou art not alone.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><a href=\"http://pre13.deviantart.net/c34f/th/pre/f/2007/299/4/a/phalanx_fandom_by_rivetwenchchic.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><u><a href=\"http://pre13.deviantart.net/c34f/th/pre/f/2007/299/4/a/phalanx_fandom_by_rivetwenchchic.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://pre13.deviantart.net/c34f/th/...twenchchic.jpg</a></u></span></a></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Legend </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Watchful</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Life </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Loyal</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Mental Attributes </b></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Intelligence 2, Wits 3, Resolve 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Physical Attributes</b> Strength 2, Dexterity 2, Stamina 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Social Attributes </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Presence 3, Manipulation 3, Composure 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Mental Skills </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Academics (Deserts) 1, Crafts (Auto Repair) 1, Investigation 2, Medicine 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Physical Skills </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Athletics 2, Brawl 2, Drive 1, Stealth 2, Survival (Desert) 3</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Social Skills </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Empathy 2, Intimidation 2, Persuasion 3, Streetwise 1, Subterfuge 3</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Atavisms </b>Siren\u2019s Treacherous Song, Eye of Heaven</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Nightmares </b>Run Away, You Can\u2019t Wake Up, Tabula Rasa</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Merits </b>Anonymity 3, Direction Sense 1, Direction Sense (Advanced) 2, Language (Iremite) 1, Multi-Lingual (Spanish, English) 1, Patient 1, Fast-Talking 2 (Always Be Closing, Jargon)<br /> <br /> <b>Willpower </b>4<br /> <b>Satiety </b>5<br /> <b>Lair</b> 2<br /> <b>Defense</b> 4<br /> <b>Health</b> 7<br /> <b>Initiative</b> 4</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Lair Traits</span></b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Extreme Heat</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Mirages</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Blazing Light</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Starting Satiety Questions</span></b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Who are your kin?</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Mummies, specifically Djet-Hu-Ta +1</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Does your belly fill easily? </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Yes, Yaritza makes sure to each frequently enough that her Horror doesn\u2019t cause terrible nightmares. +1</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Are you a social predator?</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> No. Yaritza angsts alone. +0</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>How frequently do you show your true self? </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Infrequently. Survival in the desert means not using more of your resources than you have to. +1</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">How drawn to your Lair are you?</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> Very. She\u2019s got Lair 2. +0</span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}